  "name": "Furrydelphia",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Furrydelphia (FD) is an annual furry convention in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, owned and operated by Furrydelphia, Inc., a 501(c)(3) non-profit. It was founded in late 2016, and the first edition was held August 17 to 20, 2017, at the DoubleTree Valley Forge in King of Prussia, the first furry convention in the Philadelphia area since Anthrocon moved to Pittsburgh in 2006. It moved to the Valley Forge Casino Resort in 2019 and to the Sheraton Philadelphia Downtown in 2022. A free virtual event, Furrydelphia VirtualCon, took place in 2020, with livestreamed panels and DJ sets and a VRChat mockup of the casino lobby. Attendance has grown from 718 in 2017 to over 4,600 in 2026.",
